      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/norwood_nelson_county_virginia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Norwood sits at confluence of James and Tye Rivers, a low‑relief setting contrasting Blue Ridge, influencing local microclimates.",
